{'symbol': 'PEP', 'date': '2023-04-26 09:01:00', 'title': 'ROLD GOLD® CELEBRATES 20TH ANNIVERSARY OF NATIONAL PRETZEL DAY BY REWARDING PRETZEL LOVERS IN NORTHEAST WITH $50,000', 'text': "ROLD GOLD ® \xa0PAYS HOMAGE TO THE REGION WHERE HARD PRETZELS WERE FIRST MADE AND ASKS PRETZEL LOVERS HOW THEY JUST ADD GOLD™ FOR A CHANCE TO WIN PLANO,\xa0TEXAS, APRIL 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROLD GOLD ® COMMEMORATES THE HARD PRETZEL'S LEGACY IN THE NORTHEAST THIS NATIONAL PRETZEL DAY BY GIVING AWAY CASH PRIZES TO FANS ACROSS THE AREA. THE ICONIC BRAND THAT'S SHOWN UP FOR PRETZEL LOVERS FOR MORE THAN 100 YEARS CALLS ON SNACKERS TO SHARE ALL THE WAYS THEY JUST ADD GOLD™ TO THEIR SPECIAL MOMENTS – HOW THEY ENJOY ROLD GOLD PRETZELS FROM DIPPING AND PAIRING TO GROUP GET-TOGETHERS AND SOLO OCCASIONS – FOR A CHANCE TO TAKE HOME A SHARE OF THE CASH PRIZE."}